iagnosis that would  prove Trump had diminished capacity for  understanding the real world which for  Trump really would be dementia or  Alzheimer's long story short I think we  shouldn't be counting on it and quite  frankly I think we shouldn't even really  be thinking about it let's let the  investigations happen as  they should as as Robert Moeller is  carrying them out and then we'll deal  with the consequences if and when we we  know them and in the meantime let's try  to keep winning some elections like  Democrats were able to do on Tuesday  this week
 

